<title>USA: Mercantile Jan same-store sales up 11 pct.</title>
<headline>Mercantile Jan same-store sales up 11 pct.</headline>
<dateline>FAIRFIELD, Ohio 1997-02-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mercantile Stores Co Inc said on a matching four-week basis, total sales rose 12 percent while comparable store sales rose 11.3 percent.</p>
<p>The periods involved in this matching week comparison are the four weeks ended February 1, 1997, versus the four weeks ended February 3, 1996.</p>
<p>Total sales for the four-week period were $142.6 million compared to $134.7 million.</p>
</text>
